#: ../../source/docs/internal-leak-failsafe.rst:5
#: c4b99584871549d1a0f8b748b232ba58
msgid "Internal Leak Failsafe"
msgstr "内部进水故障保护"

#: ../../source/docs/internal-leak-failsafe.rst:7
#: a98c5c201b694074a683503dfdd36792
msgid ""
"If sub is equipped with a leak detector internally, then a failsafe can be "
"enabled when a leak is detected. Sub provides the ability to have up to "
"three detectors. Each detector can be either analog or digital. When a leak "
"from any detector is detected, a failsafe can be enabled to occur."
msgstr ""
"如果水下机器人内部装有进水检测器，则可在检测到进水时启用故障保护。水下机器人最多支持三个检测器，每个检测器可以是模拟或数字类型。当任意检测器检测到进水时，可启用相应的故障保护。"

#: ../../source/docs/internal-leak-failsafe.rst:9
#: a7f0f34ca9d34638a57600f1491ea18e
msgid ""
"For the remainder of this article, the first leak detector's parameters will"
" used for example."
msgstr "本文其余部分将以第一个进水检测器的参数为例进行说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/internal-leak-failsafe.rst:12
#: 2559ae92ae774ad68c7381a0a382e95f
msgid "When the failsafe will trigger"
msgstr "何时触发故障保护"

#: ../../source/docs/internal-leak-failsafe.rst:13
#: 4b0b5c6fcbea4260851590cb4a17c367
msgid ""
"If :ref:`FS_LEAK_ENABLE<FS_LEAK_ENABLE>` is non-zero, then if the detector "
"attached to a logical pin on the autopilot designated by "
":ref:`LEAK1_PIN<LEAK1_PIN>` is analog (:ref:`LEAK1_TYPE<LEAK1_TYPE>` = "
"\"0\"), it's considered active (\"1\") if its voltage is > 2.0V. Digital "
"sensors (:ref:`LEAK1_TYPE<LEAK1_TYPE>` = \"1\") present a logic level. "
"Whether the active level of an analog sensor or the logic level from a "
"digital sensor is taken as \"dry\" is determined by the "
":ref:`LEAK1_LOGIC<LEAK1_LOGIC>` parameter."
msgstr ""
"如果 :ref:`FS_LEAK_ENABLE<FS_LEAK_ENABLE>` 非零，则当连接到 "
":ref:`LEAK1_PIN<LEAK1_PIN>` "
"所指定自动驾驶仪逻辑引脚的检测器为模拟类型（:ref:`LEAK1_TYPE<LEAK1_TYPE>` = 「0」）时，若其电压 > 2.0V "
"则视为激活（「1」）。数字传感器（:ref:`LEAK1_TYPE<LEAK1_TYPE>` = "
"「1」）呈现逻辑电平。模拟传感器的激活电平或数字传感器的逻辑电平是否被视为「干燥」由 :ref:`LEAK1_LOGIC<LEAK1_LOGIC>` "
"参数决定。"

#: ../../source/docs/internal-leak-failsafe.rst:16
#: cd94638451db496b9eb175af70f6736b
msgid "What will happen"
msgstr "将会发生什么"

#: ../../source/docs/internal-leak-failsafe.rst:17
#: 69d9a8d875364396ad3e8bd66cc50423
msgid ""
"When the failsafe occurs, the action taken is determined by the value of "
":ref:`FS_LEAK_ENABLE<FS_LEAK_ENABLE>`:"
msgstr "故障保护触发时，采取的动作由 :ref:`FS_LEAK_ENABLE<FS_LEAK_ENABLE>` 的值决定："

#: ../../source/docs/internal-leak-failsafe.rst:19
#: b03a17080abc4a98b366085a3e9f3eec
msgid "**Disabled** (Value 0) will disable the failsafe entirely."
msgstr "**禁用**（值 0）将完全禁用故障保护。"

#: ../../source/docs/internal-leak-failsafe.rst:20
#: 2ba0b572527d41f1b4dfffd77de32a77
msgid "**Warn Only** (Value 1) will send a GCS warning message."
msgstr "**仅警告**（值 1）将向地面站发送警告消息。"

#: ../../source/docs/internal-leak-failsafe.rst:21
#: 9a02da5ee1dd497ebd877cd732b85a2e
msgid "**Enter SURFACE Mode** (Value 2)."
msgstr "**进入 Surface 模式**（值 2）。"
